      "value": "I am not convinced this is a bug, this may be a vulnerable driver (versions 25.20.15031.5004 and 25.20.15031.9002) with a critical remote code execution vulnerability rated 10.0 on the CVSS 3.1 base score scale. See [CVE-2019-5049](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/cve-2019-5049). Read more: https://blog.talosintelligence.com/vuln-spotlight-amd-radeon-ati-sept-19/\n\nIf that's the case, EasyAntiCheat is doing the right thing by blocking the graphics driver.\n\nNonetheless it's not triggered in VRChat's code, but by EasyAntiCheat. This Canny board is for bug reports about VRChat.",
